# Local Orazaka Installer Artifacts
.env
docker-compose.override.yml

# Local Multi-Modal Staging Disk
.var/staging/
var/staging/

# Master Feature Matrix Document
docs/MASTER_FEATURES.md
prompt/**



# CodeGraph local index (per-machine, not shared)
.codegraph/

# IntelliJ inspection exports (large; never index/commit)
result/

# Per-package agent files (generated by `next dev` and friends). AGENTS.md is the SOLE
# source of truth for governance and forbids a rule living anywhere but itself and
# .agent/rules/* — a second AGENTS.md per package is a second home for rules. The ROOT
# AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md are deliberately still tracked; only nested copies are ignored.
*/**/AGENTS.md
*/**/CLAUDE.md

# Claude Code workspace settings — tooling state, per-machine, not code.
.claude/

# The asset master keyring. It does not live here — this is a guard against the day someone
# points ASSETS_MASTER_KEY_FILE at the working tree (ADR-054 §3).
*.key
!**/src/test/resources/**/*.key

